@startuml F5.3-ERRO-aluno-fora-escopo
title F5.3-ERRO — 403 nova interna fora do escopo
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RequestController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Confirmar interna
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /requests\n{ onBehalfOf }
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: curso do aluno
Postgres --> Ctrl: fora de cursoIds
note right of Ctrl
  sem INSERT
end note
Ctrl --> WebApp: 403 forbidden_scope
WebApp --> Sec: AlertBanner

@enduml
